{"3830070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sweet Boom!", "steam_appid": 3830070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to Sweet Boom!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Boom is a vibrant, cartoonish, and dynamic arcade game created both for friendly get-togethers in small company and for large-scale parties! Immerse yourself in a world of crazy battles where each map is a separate era and each mode is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Worlds and Eras</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's logo is made up of letters in different styles - and that's no coincidence. Each letter is a separate world where you will fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available Time Maps:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cyberpunk | Steampunk | Western | Scandinavia | Inferno (Hell) | Dungeon | Factory | Chocolate World | Rome | Egypt | Aztecs | Candy World | Space | Mars Rover | Pirates | Arctic | Cartoon World | Jelly | Construction Site</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is made in a unique style and filled with the atmosphere of its era - from icy wastelands to scorching sands, from space stations to sweet candy kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>There is no mode-to-map binding in the game!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Battle Royale - epic battles where it's every man for himself</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Team Battles - team up with friends against other teams</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Free-for-All - chaotic skirmishes where the strongest survive</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tower Fall - the winner is the one who doesn't fall down</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Also unique modes on each map:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cyber Tumble, Steam Fray, Cactus Battle, Valhalla, Hellish Scramble, Dungeon Mayhem, Gears, Chocolate Scrapyard, Gladiators, Pharaoh Frenzy, Totem Tumble, Lollipop Brawl, Star Tumble, Martian Mayhem, Anchor Armageddon, Icy King of the Hill, Cartoon Mash, Jelly Sludge, Concrete Fall, Crane Operators.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And also - unique maps with traps, obstacles, and surprises that turn the tide of battle at the most unexpected moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Who is this game for?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Boom is created for cozy evenings with friends and for hot online battles. Easy to learn but deep in tactics - the game will give you a sea of laughter, emotions, and bright moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modes and maps will expand along with the game's development - based on your feedback and wishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to blow up this world together? Forward to victory!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830070/extras/93159c5654a073b988629d119d4af638.avif?t=1781505770\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to Sweet Boom!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Boom is a vibrant, cartoonish, and dynamic arcade game created both for friendly get-togethers in small company and for large-scale parties! Immerse yourself in a world of crazy battles where each map is a separate era and each mode is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Worlds and Eras</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's logo is made up of letters in different styles - and that's no coincidence. Each letter is a separate world where you will fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available Time Maps:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cyberpunk | Steampunk | Western | Scandinavia | Inferno (Hell) | Dungeon | Factory | Chocolate World | Rome | Egypt | Aztecs | Candy World | Space | Mars Rover | Pirates | Arctic | Cartoon World | Jelly | Construction Site</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is made in a unique style and filled with the atmosphere of its era - from icy wastelands to scorching sands, from space stations to sweet candy kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>There is no mode-to-map binding in the game!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Battle Royale - epic battles where it's every man for himself</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Team Battles - team up with friends against other teams</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Free-for-All - chaotic skirmishes where the strongest survive</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tower Fall - the winner is the one who doesn't fall down</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Also unique modes on each map:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cyber Tumble, Steam Fray, Cactus Battle, Valhalla, Hellish Scramble, Dungeon Mayhem, Gears, Chocolate Scrapyard, Gladiators, Pharaoh Frenzy, Totem Tumble, Lollipop Brawl, Star Tumble, Martian Mayhem, Anchor Armageddon, Icy King of the Hill, Cartoon Mash, Jelly Sludge, Concrete Fall, Crane Operators.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And also - unique maps with traps, obstacles, and surprises that turn the tide of battle at the most unexpected moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Who is this game for?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Boom is created for cozy evenings with friends and for hot online battles. Easy to learn but deep in tactics - the game will give you a sea of laughter, emotions, and bright moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modes and maps will expand along with the game's development - based on your feedback and wishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to blow up this world together? Forward to victory!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img